line crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829330/extras/289b242d44e842f7f93934f1e8a54fd0.poster.avif?t=1711037282\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829330/extras/289b242d44e842f7f93934f1e8a54fd0.webm?t=1711037282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Players hit the wall during the jump can accumulate air slot \u2192 fill the air slot and then press the jump key \u2192 Automatically become a super jump that can adjust the flight direction by itself<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829330/extras/9da74615631e367bca69529d9e306eb2.poster.avif?t=1711037282\" width=480 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829330/extras/9da74615631e367bca69529d9e306eb2.webm?t=1711037282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2829330/extras/9da74615631e367bca69529d9e306eb2.mp4?t=1711037282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>OK, let's start our headache-like overtime experience!</strong>",
